          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Playing with Constructions"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.118,
            0.835,
            0.204
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "One of the ways of marking B is by taking a ruler and trying to move it around to get a point on line l that is 7 cm from point D. However, this requires trial and error. There is another efficient method which doesn’t involve trial and error."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.208,
            0.836,
            0.272
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "For this, instead of trying to get that one required point of distance 7 cm from D, let us explore a way of getting all the points of distance 7 cm from D."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.197,
            0.277,
            0.506,
            0.298
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We know what this shape is!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.155,
            0.32,
            0.268,
            0.361
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Step 3 Method 1"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.273,
            0.367,
            0.677,
            0.675
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 5,
              "bbox": [
                0.273,
                0.367,
                0.677,
                0.675
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_22_image_5.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.155,
            0.699,
            0.785,
            0.72
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Construct a circle of radius 7 cm with point D as the centre."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.155,
            0.727,
            0.833,
            0.771
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Can you spot the point B here? Remember that it is 7 cm away from point D and on the line l."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.781,
            0.833,
            0.846
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Consider the point at which the circle and the line intersect. What is its distance from point D? If needed, check your figure. What do you observe?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.855,
            0.833,
            0.898
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The point where the circle intersects the line l is the required point B."
            }
          ]
        },
